    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/property-broker/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Property Broker Theme is a sophisticated and professional solution tailored for the real estate industry, widely searched as a real estate listing theme, property marketplace template, housing portal design, broker website layout, and realtor business theme. Ideal for real estate brokers, property agents, consultants, developers, investors, and property managers, it helps showcase listings across residential, commercial, industrial, and rental sectors with clarity and impact. Whether promoting luxury homes, vacation rentals, condos, apartments, villas, multifamily developments, or investment properties, the theme provides a powerful and user-friendly platform to present properties and services. Built with the Real Estate Manager plugin and compatible with the Real Estate Plugin for enhanced listing control, it supports seamless customization, front-end property submission, and advanced management without coding. Its elegant layout, clean typography, and modern visual structure ensure a professional and engaging property website. The theme includes advanced tools such as smart property search filters, map-based location display, listing galleries, virtual tours, mortgage calculators, lead capture forms, and strong call-to-action sections to drive inquiries. Optimized for real estate SEO, fast performance, and full mobile responsiveness, and supporting IDX and MLS connectivity, it is well suited for property listing platforms, real estate agencies, housing marketplaces, property portfolios, smart home showcases, and real estate marketing websites."
    },
